# SmartMarketBot ROS2 — Quy trinh AI

## Quy trinh (6 buoc)

1. **Len ke hoach truoc** — Task khong don gian: neu ro spec, launch argument, topic/frame_ids anh huong, package nao se doi; tranh mo ho truoc khi code.
2. **Kiem tra lien tuc** — Sau moi thay doi: `colcon build`, xem diff, `ros2 launch ... --show-args` de verify launch file cu phap; khong chap nhan output AI ma khong verify.
3. **Giu don gian** — Uu tien diff nho, it launch argument thua; hoi "co cach don gian hon khong?" truoc khi them parameter.
4. **Chi sua can thiet** — Khong refactor / format file ngoai pham vi task; khong doi topic names, frame_ids, message types neu khong duoc yeu cau.
5. **Huong ket qua** — Dinh nghia xong khi nao (build pass, launch syntax OK, ros2 topic list cho output mong doi); lap lai den dat.
6. **Phan tach cong viec** — Research codebase / launch files / docs co the tach task; tong hop ket qua truoc khi commit.

## Nguyen tac cot loi

- **Don gian truoc** — Code giai quyet dung bai toan, khong doan. Mot launch file dang chay tot xin dung lau hon launch file "sach hon" bi loi.
- **Khong luoi** — Tim root cause (vi du: launch file bi sai, build error o package nao, dependency missing); khong workaround tam thoi che warning.
- **Tac dong toi thieu** — Khong tao side effect cho package khac trong workspace; khong vo hop dong topic/frame_id voi firmware dang chay.

## Pham vi role (chi ROS2)

- Lam viec trong `~/ros2_ws/`; khong sua `SuperMarketBot-IOT/` (ESP32 firmware) tru khi user yeu cau ro.
- Khi doi launch file → test `ros2 launch <pkg> <file>.launch.py --show-args` (no need hardware).
- Khi doi URDF / SDF → test `check_urdf <file>` (urdfdom) va `gz sim -s -r <world>` headless.
- Khi doi topic / frame_id → cap nhat `docs/TOPIC_CONTRACT.md` dong thoi.
- Khi can package moi (apt khong co cho "lyrical") → clone source, ghi ro vao `ros2_ws.repos` de teammate may khac pull lai duoc.

## Build & verify commands

```bash
# Source ROS2 (phai chay truoc moi lenh ros2)
source /opt/ros/${ROS_DISTRO:-lyrical}/setup.bash

# Build 1 package (sau khi sua)
colcon build --packages-select <pkg_name> --symlink-install

# Build toan bo (bo qua slam_toolbox vendor theo .colcon_defaults)
colcon build

# Verify launch file cu phap (no need robot)
ros2 launch <pkg> <file>.launch.py --show-args

# Check URDF (can `sudo apt install liburdfdom-tools`)
check_urdf <path>.urdf

# List topics hien co
ros2 topic list

# Test message contract (verify topic type + frame_id)
ros2 topic info /scan --verbose
```
